break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに会いたくてうずうず"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/2265829/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/2265829/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\nとにかく楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/2265829/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわっほい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にーぎーにーぎー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/2265829/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/2265829/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものべびスマイルで待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/2265829/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔いっぱい元気いっぱいになりますように:)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にこにこにこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたん*****bA by marika"}],"source":"archive"}}